{
  "info": {
    "name": "Washermann API",
    "description": "Washermann Platform API — Phase 1: Auth & Users | Phase 2: Companies & Tiers | Phase 3: Financial Foundation (Wallets, WashPoints, Top-up)\n\n## Setup\n1. Set the `baseUrl` variable to your API URL (default: http://localhost:3000/api/v1)\n2. Use **POST /auth/login** or **POST /auth/register** — the collection auto-sets `accessToken`, `refreshToken`, and `topupKey` variables.\n3. All authenticated requests automatically use the `accessToken` variable.\n4. Set `companyId`, `tierId`, `employeeId`, `userId`, `paymentReference` variables as you work through the respective endpoints.\n\n## Financial Flow\n1. Call `GET /conversion-rates/active` to see the current NGN → WashPoint rate.\n2. Call `POST /wallets/me/topup` with the `X-WM-Topup-Code` header (generated by mobile app using `topupKey`) to initiate payment.\n3. Pay via the Paystack authorization URL returned.\n4. Paystack posts to `POST /webhooks/paystack` — wallet is credited automatically.\n5. Use `GET /wallets/me/topup/:reference` as a mobile fallback to verify payment status.",
    "version": "3.0.0",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl",           "value": "http://localhost:3000/api/v1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "accessToken",       "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "refreshToken",      "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "topupKey",          "value": "", "type": "string", "description": "Per-user HMAC key returned at login. Used by the mobile app to generate X-WM-Topup-Code." },
    { "key": "paymentReference",  "value": "", "type": "string", "description": "Paystack transaction reference (wm_<uuid>). Auto-set after initiating a top-up." },
    { "key": "companyId",         "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "tierId",            "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "employeeId",        "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "userId",            "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "description": "Authentication, registration and identity flows",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "exec": [
                "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                "  const res = pm.response.json();",
                "  pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', res.data.accessToken);",
                "  pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', res.data.refreshToken);",
                "  if (res.data.topupKey) pm.collectionVariables.set('topupKey', res.data.topupKey);",
                "  pm.test('Registration successful', () => pm.expect(res.success).to.be.true);",
                "  pm.test('Access token present', () => pm.expect(res.data.accessToken).to.be.a('string'));",
                "}"
              ],
              "type": "text/javascript"
            }
          }],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"fullName\": \"John Doe\",\n  \"email\": \"john@example.com\",\n  \"phone\": \"+2348012345678\",\n  \"password\": \"StrongP@ssw0rd\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "register"] },
            "description": "Register a new user (self-signup). Automatically sets accessToken and refreshToken collection variables."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "exec": [
                "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                "  const res = pm.response.json();",
                "  pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', res.data.accessToken);",
                "  pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', res.data.refreshToken);",
                "  if (res.data.topupKey) pm.collectionVariables.set('topupKey', res.data.topupKey);",
                "  pm.test('Login successful', () => pm.expect(res.success).to.be.true);",
                "  pm.test('Access token present', () => pm.expect(res.data.accessToken).to.be.a('string'));",
                "}"
              ],
              "type": "text/javascript"
            }
          }],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"identifier\": \"john@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"StrongP@ssw0rd\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "login"] },
            "description": "Login with email or phone + password. Automatically sets accessToken and refreshToken."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Check Identifier",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"identifier\": \"john@example.com\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/check", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "check"] },
            "description": "Identifier-first flow. Returns: not_found | active | pending_activation | suspended. Mobile uses this to route to the correct screen."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Activate Account",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "exec": [
                "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                "  const res = pm.response.json();",
                "  pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', res.data.accessToken);",
                "  pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', res.data.refreshToken);",
                "  pm.test('Activation successful', () => pm.expect(res.success).to.be.true);",
                "}"
              ],
              "type": "text/javascript"
            }
          }],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"identifier\": \"jane@company.com\",\n  \"password\": \"StrongP@ssw0rd\",\n  \"fullName\": \"Jane Smith\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/activate", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "activate"] },
            "description": "Activate a pre-created (invited) account. Used when user installs app fresh without clicking the invite deep-link."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Set Password (Deep-Link Flow)",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "exec": [
                "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                "  const res = pm.response.json();",
                "  pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', res.data.accessToken);",
                "  pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', res.data.refreshToken);",
                "}"
              ],
              "type": "text/javascript"
            }
          }],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"inviteToken\": \"uuid-from-deep-link\",\n  \"password\": \"StrongP@ssw0rd\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/set-password", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "set-password"] },
            "description": "Happy-path for invite flow. Used when user taps the deep-link from SMS/email and the app intercepts the token."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh Token",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": {
              "exec": [
                "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                "  const res = pm.response.json();",
                "  pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', res.data.accessToken);",
                "  pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', res.data.refreshToken);",
                "  pm.test('Tokens refreshed', () => pm.expect(res.success).to.be.true);",
                "}"
              ],
              "type": "text/javascript"
            }
          }],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "refresh"] },
            "description": "Exchange refresh token for a new access + refresh token pair. Uses token rotation — old refresh token is invalidated."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/logout", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "logout"] },
            "description": "Invalidate the current refresh token. Requires Bearer auth."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Verify OTP",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"identifier\": \"john@example.com\",\n  \"otp\": \"482910\",\n  \"channel\": \"email\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-otp", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "verify-otp"] },
            "description": "Verify email or phone using the 6-digit OTP sent after registration. channel: 'email' | 'phone'."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Resend OTP",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"identifier\": \"john@example.com\",\n  \"purpose\": \"verification\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/resend-otp", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "resend-otp"] },
            "description": "Resend OTP. purpose: 'verification' | 'reset'. Rate limited to 1 request per 60 seconds."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Forgot Password",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"identifier\": \"john@example.com\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/forgot-password", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "forgot-password"] },
            "description": "Request a password reset OTP. Sends a 6-digit code via email and/or SMS. Always returns 200 (prevents enumeration)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Reset Password",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"identifier\": \"john@example.com\",\n  \"otp\": \"391047\",\n  \"password\": \"NewStrongP@ssw0rd\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/reset-password", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "reset-password"] },
            "description": "Reset password using identifier + 6-digit OTP received via email/SMS. OTP expires in 10 minutes."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Me",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/me", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "me"] },
            "description": "Get current authenticated user info and roles."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Setup Super Admin (first-run)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"setupSecret\": \"your-ADMIN_SETUP_SECRET-from-env\",\n  \"fullName\": \"Super Admin\",\n  \"email\": \"admin@washermann.com\",\n  \"phone\": \"+2348012345678\",\n  \"password\": \"Admin@Str0ng!\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/setup", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "setup"] },
            "description": "One-time endpoint to create the first super admin. Requires ADMIN_SETUP_SECRET from .env. Disabled once any admin exists."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Users",
      "description": "User profile, address management and company membership view",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Profile",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users/me", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["users", "me"] },
            "description": "Get the authenticated user's profile."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Profile",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"fullName\": \"John Doe Updated\",\n  \"email\": \"newemail@example.com\",\n  \"phone\": \"+2348099999999\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users/me", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["users", "me"] },
            "description": "Update own profile. All fields are optional."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get My Companies",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users/me/companies", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["users", "me", "companies"] },
            "description": "List all active company memberships for the authenticated employee. Returns assignment records with company and tier details."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Addresses",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users/me/addresses", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["users", "me", "addresses"] },
            "description": "List all saved addresses for the authenticated user. Default address appears first."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Add Address",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"addressText\": \"12 Admiralty Way, Lekki Phase 1, Lagos\",\n  \"latitude\": 6.4281,\n  \"longitude\": 3.4219,\n  \"isDefault\": true\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users/me/addresses", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["users", "me", "addresses"] },
            "description": "Add a new address. If isDefault is true, existing default is unset. First address is automatically set as default."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Address",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"addressText\": \"15 Victoria Island, Lagos\",\n  \"latitude\": 6.4281,\n  \"longitude\": 3.4219\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users/me/addresses/:id",
